<title>USA: Polaroid Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Polaroid Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.35     loss	 $1.33</p>
<p> Net profit		15,800     loss	60,700</p>
<p> Net Sales		457,500		  461,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  44,829		   45,520</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended March 30 vs March 31.</p>
<p>Q1 profit excluding net after-tax exchange gains was $0.13 a share vs loss $0.07 before restructuring and other expenses and a gain on the sale of real estate.</p>
<p>Q1 operating profit was $19.2 million vs $4.5 million, excluding pre-tax special charges for restructuring and other expenses of $110 million.</p>
</text>
